                    <img src="~/assets/img/RE/sandprovidor.png" alt="Sand Supplier" class="img-fluid mb-1 mx-auto d-block w-100 object-fit-cover" style="aspect-ratio: 16 / 10; max-height: 250px;">
                    <div class="text-dark fw-semibold mt-auto">Sand Supplier</div>
